  "_comment": "Career Navigator rule tables (ADR 0007). The single source for app/domains/career; any future browser engine must read this file, never restate it (spec §16.1 option B). Patterns are Python regular expressions; 'flags' is 'i' or ''. Reconstructed from 'VeteranOS Career Navigator — Architecture' (2026-10-29): where that document gives a pattern verbatim it is used verbatim (JS version where the two runtimes diverged, since the spec judges JS the correct one); REQ_CATEGORY_RULES and the full STOPWORDS list are described there only by intent, so these were written from that intent and are pinned by tests, not copied.",
